WEBVTT

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:30.304
build something that nature has never had
the opportunity to work with yet.

00:04:30.954 --> 00:04:33.272
And so here's the periodic table.

00:04:33.296 --> 00:04:35.083
I absolutely love the periodic table.

00:04:35.107 --> 00:04:37.732
Every year for the incoming
freshman class at MIT,

00:04:37.756 --> 00:04:39.683
I have a periodic table made that says,

00:04:39.707 --> 00:04:41.844
"Welcome to MIT.
Now you're in your element."

00:04:41.868 --> 00:04:42.877
(Laughter)

00:04:42.901 --> 00:04:45.190
And you flip it over,
and it's the amino acids

00:04:45.214 --> 00:04:47.676
with the pH at which they have
different charges.

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:50.676
And so I give this out
to thousands of people.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.796
And I know it says MIT
and this is Caltech,

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.884
but I have a couple extra
if people want it.

00:04:54.908 --> 00:04:59.227
I was really fortunate to have
President Obama visit my lab this year

00:04:59.251 --> 00:05:00.640
on his visit to MIT,